  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Any protests Sayori might have had fade away as she raises a ward, as
      per your command.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099597357023376
    - rid: 268099597357023377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: From the end of the hallway, fire starts blasting toward the party.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099597357023378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: All of which hits Sayori's ward, causing it to be nullified before it
      can hurt anybody.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Good thinking, apprentice. We need to make it to the end of the hallway
      to disarm that trap.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks to Sayori's unyielding ward, the party is able to make to the
      end of the hallway and disarm the trap.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099597357023379
    - rid: 268099597357023380
    - rid: 268099597357023381
    - rid: 268099597357023384
